{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Gameplay</h2>In this demo, a special roguelike mode will be avaiable for you to experience the battle and units mechanics:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players will now navigate their adventure on a hex-based map featuring diverse floor designs.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405170/extras/MapJump.gif?t=1749659217\" /><br></li><li>Explore various hex-node types, including battles, treasure chests, and scenario events, to strengthen your units.<br></li><li>Upgrade Hiro\u2019s abilities after each run to take on even more formidable foes!<br></li><li>Collects god's boon and relics to improve your team power.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405170/extras/relics.gif?t=1749659217\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405170/extras/boons.png?t=1749659217\" /></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chess-style tower defense</h2>Strategically position your units onto a chess-based battlefield to defend your territories.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405170/extras/placing.gif?t=1749659217\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405170?t=1749659217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405170?t=1749659217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405170/aae6dbd07efbcd55b7c2b6659c28726384f28347/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749659217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405170/aae6dbd07efbcd55b7c2b6659c28726384f28347/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749659217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Mat